1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,377 --> 00:00:45,964
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,091 --> 00:00:48,317
=Episode 10=

4
00:00:48,659 --> 00:00:49,419
Your Majesty.

5
00:00:49,739 --> 00:00:51,500
I brought you a revitalizing tonic.

6
00:00:56,299 --> 00:00:57,059
Your Majesty.

7
00:00:57,579 --> 00:00:58,979
You've been back for days

8
00:00:59,059 --> 00:01:00,419
and haven't come to see me once.

9
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:20,940
You wretch.

10
00:01:28,692 --> 00:01:30,060
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

11
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:31,899
Something terrible has happened!

12
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:38,140
(Physician)

13
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:38,605
Come here.

14
00:01:40,539 --> 00:01:41,220
What are you doing?

15
00:01:41,659 --> 00:01:42,220
What are you doing?

16
00:01:43,580 --> 00:01:44,259
You shameless woman.

17
00:01:44,753 --> 00:01:46,620
You think tricks like this will win
His Majesty's favor?

18
00:01:46,845 --> 00:01:48,060
I'll teach you a lesson today.

19
00:01:48,379 --> 00:01:50,880
A lowly weed belongs in the mud
and should rot there forever.

20
00:01:51,819 --> 00:01:52,659
Beat her.

21
00:01:53,299 --> 00:01:53,940
Wanniang!

22
00:01:58,700 --> 00:01:59,580
Stop hitting her!

23
00:01:59,739 --> 00:02:00,580
Stop it!

24
00:02:26,620 --> 00:02:27,419
(Shouhe.)

25
00:02:28,819 --> 00:02:29,900
(Back then, you must have been)

26
00:02:30,740 --> 00:02:32,900
(in even more pain than I am now.)

27
00:03:09,060 --> 00:03:09,620
Su Cao.

28
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:18,000
(Physician)

29
00:03:18,050 --> 00:03:20,930
♪The cool night flows like water♪

30
00:03:21,020 --> 00:03:21,819
Mr. Gu.

31
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:22,875
♪Jackdaws sigh♪

32
00:03:22,940 --> 00:03:23,620
Su Cao.

33
00:03:24,740 --> 00:03:25,859
Quick! Summon the imperial physician!

34
00:03:26,446 --> 00:03:26,819
Yes.

35
00:03:26,819 --> 00:03:27,259
Your Majesty.

36
00:03:27,259 --> 00:03:27,740
You...

37
00:03:29,659 --> 00:03:30,859
You're the Emperor.

38
00:03:31,620 --> 00:03:32,259
I kept the truth from you

39
00:03:33,259 --> 00:03:34,500
because I was afraid...

40
00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:37,819
Afraid you'd pull away from me.

41
00:03:40,206 --> 00:03:40,940
Mr. Gu...

42
00:03:41,946 --> 00:03:42,579
No...

43
00:03:43,693 --> 00:03:44,772
Your Majesty.

44
00:03:46,379 --> 00:03:47,539
Please leave.

45
00:03:49,419 --> 00:03:50,539
I don't know

46
00:03:51,020 --> 00:03:52,419
how to face you.

47
00:03:54,460 --> 00:03:55,940
I know you're angry.

48
00:03:58,780 --> 00:03:59,819
What happened today

49
00:04:00,979 --> 00:04:02,180
was my fault.

50
00:04:03,180 --> 00:04:04,579
Give me a chance to make it up to you.

51
00:04:05,900 --> 00:04:06,419
Please.

52
00:04:07,290 --> 00:04:09,103
♪With bamboo staff and straw sandals♪

53
00:04:09,276 --> 00:04:11,249
♪Through endless mist and rain♪

54
00:04:11,333 --> 00:04:15,660
♪I cross the wilds with solitude♪

55
00:04:16,463 --> 00:04:20,376
♪A flute echoes by the broken bridge♪

56
00:04:20,496 --> 00:04:25,889
♪Years pass, my tears dry in the wind♪

57
00:04:26,096 --> 00:04:31,089
♪All in vain♪

58
00:04:41,139 --> 00:04:41,980
It's late.

59
00:04:42,699 --> 00:04:43,779
Please go, Your Majesty.

60
00:04:50,259 --> 00:04:52,339
I thought of so many ways

61
00:04:52,660 --> 00:04:53,540
to tell you who I really am.

62
00:04:55,699 --> 00:04:57,339
When we picked flowers on the mountain.

63
00:04:58,819 --> 00:05:00,500
When we sheltered from the rain.

64
00:05:01,352 --> 00:05:02,273
When you taught me

65
00:05:02,500 --> 00:05:03,860
to weave that grasshopper.

66
00:05:06,019 --> 00:05:07,660
But every time I was about to tell you,

67
00:05:09,219 --> 00:05:10,459
I held back.

68
00:05:13,540 --> 00:05:14,819
Because I couldn't bear to give up

69
00:05:17,259 --> 00:05:18,779
being your Mr. Gu.

70
00:05:22,740 --> 00:05:24,459
But you're not really Mr. Gu.

71
00:05:25,019 --> 00:05:26,339
You're a dragon soaring in the heavens.

72
00:05:26,940 --> 00:05:28,579
I'm nothing but a weed on the ground.

73
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:33,219
Before I knew you were the Emperor,

74
00:05:34,019 --> 00:05:35,259
you were simply Mr. Gu to me.

75
00:05:35,860 --> 00:05:37,060
But now that I know...

76
00:05:38,980 --> 00:05:39,699
Mr. Gu

77
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:43,060
can only exist in my dreams.

78
00:05:45,860 --> 00:05:47,300
Once I've recovered,

79
00:05:47,899 --> 00:05:48,579
I'll leave the capital.

80
00:05:50,259 --> 00:05:51,100
In this life,

81
00:05:51,940 --> 00:05:52,940
we'll never meet again.

82
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:03,620
Come back to the palace with me.

83
00:06:04,819 --> 00:06:06,459
I'm not ordering you as the Emperor.

84
00:06:08,899 --> 00:06:10,500
I'm asking you

85
00:06:12,139 --> 00:06:12,899
as Mr. Gu.

86
00:06:19,779 --> 00:06:20,540
Mr. Gu...

87
00:06:22,699 --> 00:06:24,300
are you still my Mr. Gu?

88
00:06:36,139 --> 00:06:37,379
I'm still your Mr. Gu.

89
00:06:39,019 --> 00:06:39,980
In this life,

90
00:06:42,740 --> 00:06:43,940
I'll always be your Mr. Gu.

91
00:07:10,529 --> 00:07:14,716
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

92
00:07:14,850 --> 00:07:18,463
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

93
00:07:18,698 --> 00:07:21,297
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

94
00:07:21,334 --> 00:07:23,614
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

95
00:07:23,661 --> 00:07:27,490
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

96
00:07:27,892 --> 00:07:31,245
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

97
00:07:32,172 --> 00:07:35,685
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

98
00:07:36,185 --> 00:07:38,752
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

99
00:07:38,878 --> 00:07:40,911
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

100
00:07:40,978 --> 00:07:44,755
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

101
00:07:45,105 --> 00:07:49,438
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

102
00:07:49,661 --> 00:07:53,168
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

103
00:07:53,349 --> 00:07:56,202
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

104
00:07:56,269 --> 00:08:01,883
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

105
00:08:01,923 --> 00:08:04,937
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

106
00:08:04,978 --> 00:08:10,986
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

107
00:08:11,653 --> 00:08:18,608
♪The past has faded away♪

108
00:08:18,608 --> 00:08:22,608
♪The past has faded away♪
